{"ID":"20240205153649-10vii5h","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153649-10vii5h","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153649-10vii5h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140708-7yk5ptb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163943-k4wxu2b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140708-7yk5ptb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:207,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:207\u0026#125;","title":"昆布","type":"doc","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206140708-7yk5ptb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140708-7yk5ptb","updated":"20240206140717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产辽宁、山东等地。\n【性状】\t海带：卷曲折叠成团状，或缠结成把。全体呈黑褐色或绿褐色，表面附有白霜。用水浸软则膨胀成扁平长带状，长50150cm，宽1040cm，中部较厚，边缘较薄而呈波状。类革质，残存柄部扁圆柱状。气腥，味咸。\n昆布：卷曲皱缩成不规则团状。全体呈黑色，较薄。用水浸软则膨胀呈扁平的叶状，长宽约为16"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"26cm，厚约1.6mm；两侧呈羽状深裂，裂片呈长舌状，边缘有小齿或全缘。质柔滑。\n【性味】\t咸，寒。\n【功效】\t软坚散结，消痰，利水。用于瘿瘤，瘰疬，睾丸肿痛，痰饮水肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240206140709-c7mpslz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140709-c7mpslz","updated":"20240206140709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206140709-btfhasd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163943-k4wxu2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163943-k4wxu2b","updated":"20240205163943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布-20240205163943-w12bpw7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714095721-7e8hc2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714095721-7e8hc2r","updated":"20240714095721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 5-20240714095721-wggtxbh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714094909-018ditn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714094909-018ditn","updated":"20240714095808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 6-20240714095806-h37nhob.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714094636-a8eerk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714094636-a8eerk3","updated":"20240714095849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 7-20240714095847-rmvw418.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714095049-hu2wgte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714095049-hu2wgte","updated":"20240714102330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 357px;","style":"width: 347px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布-20240714095049-epazj2n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 347px;\" parent-style=\"width: 357px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 505px;","style":"width: 495px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 2-20240714095459-hyav9j9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 495px;\" parent-style=\"width: 505px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714101634-qvhu32t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714101634-qvhu32t","updated":"20240714101634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 600px;","style":"width: 590px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 10-20240714101634-9m6os7x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 590px;\" parent-style=\"width: 600px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 599px;","style":"width: 589px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 9-20240714101506-ihb6jom.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 589px;\" parent-style=\"width: 599px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714100247-d4wnila","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714100247-d4wnila","updated":"20240714100247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 719px;","style":"width: 709px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 8-20240714100247-l75bzvf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 709px;\" parent-style=\"width: 719px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 561px;","style":"width: 551px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 11-20240714101715-2xgofd4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 551px;\" parent-style=\"width: 561px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714102134-owcxycb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714102134-owcxycb","updated":"20240714102134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 12-20240714102134-v2pfeo3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"昆布 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/昆布 13-20240714102257-oougchb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 604px;\" parent-style=\"width: 614px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714095859-tv0na5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714095859-tv0na5w","updated":"20240714102348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：昆布取图为海藻，不敢定论，如错误烦请指正。（个人认为既然名为昆‘布’，以古人命名规律，凭感觉来想应该是一种像‘布’的藻类）"}]},{"ID":"20240714095925-jemyz7o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240714095925-jemyz7o"}},{"ID":"20240902085620-2253nz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-2253nz4","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：昆布"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-e8eedjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-e8eedjy","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昆布《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-74utlgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-74utlgs","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】KūnBù"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-gbcyqha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-gbcyqha","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】THALLUSLAMINARIAE/THALLUSECKLONIAE"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-798z5us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-798z5us","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为海带科植物海带LaminariajaponicaAresch.或翅藻科植物昆布（鹅掌菜）EckloniakuromeOkam.的干燥叶状体。夏、秋二季采捞，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-cr37mcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-cr37mcr","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-shfi6q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-shfi6q8","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海带：卷曲折叠成团状，或缠结成把。全体呈黑褐色或绿褐色，表面附有白霜。用水浸软则膨胀成扁平长带状，长50～150cm，宽10～40cm，中部较厚，边缘较薄而呈波状。类革质，残存柄部扁圆柱状。气腥，味咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-pztku99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-pztku99","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昆布：卷曲皱缩成不规则团状。全体呈黑色，较薄。用水浸软则膨胀呈扁平的叶状，长宽约为16～26cm，厚约1.6mm；两侧呈羽状深裂，裂片呈长舌状，边缘有小齿或全缘。质柔滑。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-g220tmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-g220tmb","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-gmb5f21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-gmb5f21","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品体厚，以水浸泡即膨胀，表面黏滑，附着透明黏液质。手捻不分层者为海带，分层者为昆布。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-mg770qa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-mg770qa","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品约10g,剪碎，加水200ml,浸泡数小时，滤过，滤液浓缩至约100ml。取浓缩液2～3ml，加硝酸1滴与硝酸银试液数滴，即生成黄色乳状沉淀，在氨试液中微溶解，在硝酸中不溶解。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-qvl0xx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-qvl0xx7","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去杂质，漂净，稍晾，切宽丝，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-j9w1o91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-j9w1o91","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-om27gsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-om27gsh","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝、胃、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-tls4tbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-tls4tbt","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】软坚散结，消痰，利水。用于瘿瘤，瘰疬，睾丸肿痛，痰饮水肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-5w75cl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-5w75cl9","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】6～12g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-kp87k45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-kp87k45","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-t4fs41s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-t4fs41s","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-25xq67v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-25xq67v","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昆布《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ir1uees","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ir1uees","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-rsfckbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-rsfckbn","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】KūnBù"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-nfiricj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-nfiricj","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】纶布（《吴普本草》），海昆布（《山东中药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-t9dlfx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-t9dlfx1","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为海带科植物海带、或翅藻科植物昆布、裙带菜的叶状体。夏、秋采收，由海中捞出，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ijyq7cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ijyq7cx","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-9oywdpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-9oywdpq","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①海带"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-bga8c05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-bga8c05","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生大型褐藻，植物体成熟时成带状，长可达6米以上。根状固着器粗纤维状，由数轮叉状分歧的假根组成，假根末端有吸着盘。其上为圆柱状的短柄，长5～15厘米。柄的上部为叶状体，叶状体幼时呈长卵状，后渐伸长成带状，扁平，长2～6米，宽20～50厘米，坚厚，革质状，中部稍厚，两边较薄，有波状皱褶。生殖期在叶状体两面产生孢子囊。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-5um97fq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-5um97fq","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于较冷的海洋中，多附生于大干潮线以下1～3米深处的岩礁上。分布山东，辽宁一带沿海地区。目前已有人工养殖。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-oa3kp5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-oa3kp5j","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的根状固着器（海带根）亦供药用，另详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-v8vz3yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-v8vz3yh","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②昆布，又名：面其菜、黑昆布、鹅掌菜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-68xbx60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-68xbx60","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生大型褐藻。根状固着器由树枝状的又状假根组成，数轮重叠成圆锥状，直径5～15厘米。柄部圆柱状或略扁圆形，中实，长8～100厘米，直径10～15毫米，粘液腔道呈不规则的环状，散生在皮层中。叶状体扁平，革质，微皱缩，暗褐色，厚2～3毫米，1～2回羽状深裂，两侧裂片长舌状，基部楔形，叶缘一般有粗锯齿。孢子囊群在叶状体表面形成，9～11月产生游孢子。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-vgx8d4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-vgx8d4j","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于低潮线附近的岩礁上。分布福建、浙江等沿海地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-vtbedzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-vtbedzb","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③裙带菜（姚可成《食物本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-4rn65h8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-4rn65h8","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生大型褐藻，植物体长约1～2米，宽可达1米。根状固着器纤维状，叉状分枝，在柄的下端轮生。柄短，近扁圆柱形，直径约10～15毫米。叶状体扁平，棕褐色，柔革质；中央有明显隆起的主肋，两侧较薄，通常形成多数羽状柔软的裂片，裂片边缘有缺刻，有时不分裂，则呈卵形；上面散布许多黑色小斑，全面密生粘液腺。春季在柄的两侧着生木耳状、厚而富含胶质的重叠折皱，内含孢子囊群，产生多数游孢子。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-mh9vaxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-mh9vaxp","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于低潮线以下1～4米深处的岩石上。分布浙江、福建、辽宁等沿海地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-1s77d2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-1s77d2n","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-yk0hgcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-yk0hgcl","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①海带的干燥叶状体，卷曲折叠成团，或缠结成把。全体呈绿褐色或黑褐色，表面附有白霜。用水浸软则膨胀成扁平的带状，长50～150厘米，宽10～50厘米，中部较厚，边缘较薄而呈波状。质厚，革质状而粘滑。用手捻之不分层。残存柄部扁圆柱状。有腥气，味咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-214xdko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-214xdko","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产于山东、辽宁等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ycyhz1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ycyhz1x","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②昆布的干燥叶状体，卷曲皱缩成不规则团状。全体呈黑色，表面附有白霜，质较薄。用水浸软则膨胀呈扁平的叶状，长宽均为15～26厘米，厚约1.5毫米。两侧羽状深裂，裂片长舌形，边缘有小齿。质柔滑，用手捻之可剥离为二层。有腥气，味咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-fhkcxb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-fhkcxb8","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产福建。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-1gohs0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-1gohs0r","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③裙带菜的形态与昆布相似，但全体呈棕绿色，质薄而跪，多已破碎。用水浸软后即膨胀呈扁平的叶状，中央有一筋肋，并溶出大量粘液如琼脂样，极易剥离为二层。气腥，味咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-k2l5frc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-k2l5frc","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产浙江。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-fjw5034","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-fjw5034","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上三种均以整齐、质厚、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-zh4081e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-zh4081e","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-r57spj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-r57spj4","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海带富含多糖类成分藻胶酸和昆布素、甘露醇、无机盐。干品中20～35％是无机物，水溶性盐中含氧化钾可到40％、碘0.27～0.72％，钙约1.06％、钴约22微克％、氟1.89p.p.m.，又含胡萝卜素0.042～0.77％（干品）、1.229～1.710％（鲜品）、核黄素810微克％、940微克％（二份干品），尚含维生素C、蛋白质、脯氨酸等氨基酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-i6g00ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-i6g00ue","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昆布含藻胶酸25.6％、粗蛋白9.97％、甘露醇7.21％、灰分26.03％、钾4.92％、碘0.28％。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-x8qa17l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-x8qa17l","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"裙带菜含碘、溴、钙约1.8％、藻胶酸、1，4-噻嗪烷-3-羧酸S-氧化物、核黄素210～1000微克％（二份干品）、维生素B12-0.7微克％（鲜品）、丙氨酸、甘氨酸、脯氨酸、别异亮氨酸等氨基酸、有机酸约1.6％。从甲醇油提物中还分离出亚麻酸甲酯、植物醇、棕榈酸、岩藻甾醇、大褐马尾藻甾醇、无羁萜、黑麦草内酯、甘露醇。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-7u7uyyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-7u7uyyv","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从Laminariaangustata和Eckloniacava中还分离出海带氨酸另外，在多种海藻中也检出海带氨酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-12tu2e7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-12tu2e7","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-t964fjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-t964fjr","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①对甲状腺的作用"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-g4u2j6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-g4u2j6x","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其作用是由于所含的碘、碘化物引起的。昆布可用来纠正由缺碘而引起的甲状腺机能不足，同时也可以暂时抑制甲状腺机能亢进的新陈代谢率而减轻症状，但不能持久，可作手术前的准备。碘化物进入组织及血液后，尚能促进病理产物如炎症渗出物的吸收。并能使病态的组织崩溃和溶解，故对活动性肺结核一般不用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-35zu6ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-35zu6ys","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昆布中所含之碘，较单纯的碘、碘化钾吸收慢，体内保留时间长，排出也慢。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-kzp8sac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-kzp8sac","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②降压作用"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-dseepug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-dseepug","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海带氨酸具有降压作用，海带氨酸单枸橼酸盐对麻醉兔静脉注射，可使血压短暂下降，此作用不被阿托品阻断；它不影响闭塞二侧颈总动脉或注射去甲肾上腺素引起之升压反应；在体及离体试验中，它都能抑制心跳振幅，但不影响心跳频率。对平滑肌有较显著的抑制作用，如小肠、支气管等。并能对抗乙酰胆碱、5-羟色胺、氯化钡引起之收缩；在离体鼠小肠上，对抗乙酰胆碱之效力为罂粟碱的0.8％。在离体豚鼠输精管上能增强去甲肾上腺素的作用。对蛙腹直肌之作用很弱。海带氨酸单盐酸盐亦能降压并抑制离体兔肠；但对离体兔心有轻度兴奋作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-nr5zwt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-nr5zwt9","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③平喘镇咳作用"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-26sss1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-26sss1e","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海带根粗提取液对豚鼠有平喘作用（组织胺法），对大鼠（0.59％二氧化硫法）、猫（电刺激喉上神经法）的咳嗽有一定的镇咳作用。给予中毒量可使动物运动减少、侧卧甚至昏迷而死，与可待因不同。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-jxrdd8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-jxrdd8c","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④其他作用"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-stv9j01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-stv9j01","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海藻昆布流浸膏对感染血吸虫尾蚴的家兔，有保护作用（煎剂无效）。以流浸膏2克／公斤在感染后1天开始口服，连续90天，则兔体内血吸虫虫体余存数较对照组显著减少，特别是肝脏病变远较对照组为轻微，正常结构大致保存，仅见少量虫卵结节形成，周围纤维化不显著，尤其是新生虫卵很难找到。小鼠口服海藻、昆布及全蝎、蜈蚣等之复方（化癌丹）煎剂，对艾氏腹水癌有抑制作用。昆布素对大鼠的网状肉瘤IRE（腹水型）则并无影响。昆布素为多糖类，其低程度的硫酸化物（每一葡萄糖单位含0.62硫酸根）与肝素相似，有清除血脂作用，但无显著的抗血凝作用，可用于动脉粥样硬化病人。从L.cloustoni中提得的硫酸昆布素M，静脉注射（人）后清除血脂、增加脂蛋白之电泳能力、改变脂蛋白之分布情况皆与肝素相似，唯持续时间较短（4～6小时）。肌肉注射（100毫克）效果不显著，可能由于剂量不够。海带中提取的藻胶酸钠，对动物殷动脉之出血，据云有止血作用。其他作用见\"海藻\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ne8be15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ne8be15","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去杂质，用水漂净，切成宽丝，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-feoufm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-feoufm8","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ac98yih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ac98yih","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-wdmgc39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-wdmgc39","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《吴普本草》：\"酸咸，寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-9vnqu0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-9vnqu0m","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"味苦，性寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-x0cm053","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-x0cm053","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-9ueq81l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-9ueq81l","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《要药分剂》：\"入胃经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-apor3qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-apor3qx","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"入脾经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-09t39ik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-09t39ik","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-5bqhrab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-5bqhrab","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"软坚，行水。治瘰疬，瘿瘤，噎膈，水肿，睾丸肿痛，带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-bvv6clx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-bvv6clx","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"主十二种水肿，瘿瘤聚结气，痿疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-tggahuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-tggahuc","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"利水道，去面肿，去恶疮鼠瘘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-v7imwxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-v7imwxu","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草拾遗》：\"主颓卵肿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-3ziazpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-3ziazpu","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④崔禹锡《食经》：\"治九瘘风热，热瘅，手脚疼痹，以生啖之益人。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-we2kdrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-we2kdrf","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草通玄》：\"主噎膈。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-t0ofkzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-t0ofkzv","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥姚可成《食物本草》：\"裙带菜，主女人赤白带下，男子精泄梦遗。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-u1bnhom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-u1bnhom","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《玉楸药解》：\"泄水去湿，破积软坚。\"\"清热利水，治气臌水胀，瘰疬瘿瘤，癫疝恶疮，与海藻、海带同功。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-luolxjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-luolxjg","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《现代实用中药》：\"治水肿，淋疾，湿性脚气。又治甲状腺肿，慢性气管炎，咳嗽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-owal8li","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-owal8li","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～3钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-b924n3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-b924n3v","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-r61gnvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-r61gnvc","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾胃虚寒蕴湿者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-83v0mne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-83v0mne","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《食疗本草》：\"下气，久服瘦人。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-l6hbyf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-l6hbyf1","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《品汇精要》：\"妊娠亦不可服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-qxesqbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-qxesqbt","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《医学入门》：\"胃虚者慎服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-226qv12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-226qv12","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-6tnxm1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-6tnxm1z","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治瘿气结核，癳癳肿硬：昆布一两（洗去成味）。捣罗为散。每用一钱，以绵裹于好醋中浸过，含咽津觉药味尽，即再含之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-x8u054c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-x8u054c","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治颈下卒结囊，渐大欲成瘿：昆布、海藻等分。末之，蜜丸如杏核大，含，稍稍咽汁，日四、五。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-oq1llx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-oq1llx1","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治瘿气初结，咽喉中壅闷，不治即渐渐肿大：槟榔三两，海藻二两（洗去咸），昆布三两（洗去咸水）。上药，捣罗为末，炼蜜和丸，如小弹子大，常含一丸咽津。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-yb0dahq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-yb0dahq","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治气瘿，胸膈满塞，咽喉项颈渐粗：昆布二两（洗去咸汁），通草一两，羊靥二具（炙），海蛤一两（研），马尾海藻一两（洗去咸汁）。上五味，蜜丸如弹子，细细含咽汁。忌生菜、热面、炙肉、蒜、笋。（《广济方》昆布丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-amowl7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-amowl7z","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治膈气噎塞不下食：昆布（洗净，焙，末）一两，桩杵头细糠一合，共研。用老牛涎一合，生百合汁一合，慢煎入蜜搅成膏，与末杵丸，如芡实大。每服一丸，含化咽下。（《圣济总录》昆布方）"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-4jjta3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-4jjta3q","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治气，膀胱急妨，宜下气：昆布一斤，白米泔汁浸一宿，洗去咸味，以水一斗，煮令向熟，擘长三寸、阔四、五分，仍取葱白一握，二寸切断擘之，更合熟煮令昆布极烂，仍下盐、酢、豉、糁调和，一依臛法，不得令咸酸，以生姜、橘皮、椒末等调和，宜食粳米饭、粳米粥，海藻亦依此法，极下气，大效，无所忌。（《广济方》昆布臛法）"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-l9dr7kr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-l9dr7kr","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-o4rgpk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-o4rgpk9","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"昆布，咸能软坚，其性润下，寒能除热散结，故主十二种水肿、瘿瘤聚结气、瘘疮。东垣云：瘿坚如石者，非此不除，正咸能软坚之功也。详其气味性能治疗，与海藻大略相同。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-n4mv97c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-n4mv97c","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草汇》：\"昆布之性，雄于海藻，噎症恒用之，盖取其祛老痰也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-cyaznxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-cyaznxy","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-h4x2ecw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-h4x2ecw","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昆布《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-7vpp7wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-7vpp7wk","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-j7scsf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-j7scsf4","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《吴普本草》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-10eml6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-10eml6e","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：按《吴普本草》纶布一名昆布，则《尔雅》所谓纶似纶，东海有之者，即昆布也。纶音关，青丝绶也，讹而为昆耳。陶弘景以纶为青苔、紫菜辈，谓组为昆布。陈藏器又谓纶、组是二种藻，不同如此。昆布生登、莱者，搓如绳索之状，出闽、浙者，大叶似菜。盖海中诸菜，性味相近，主疗一致，虽稍有不同，亦无大异也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-pqeklub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-pqeklub","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】KūnBù"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ccfqf2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ccfqf2t","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】Kelp，Tangle"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-23wcv7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-23wcv7h","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】纶布、海昆布"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-j4gwjyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-j4gwjyl","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-1998h0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-1998h0e","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为海带科(昆布科)植物昆布及翅藻科植物黑昆布、裙带菜的叶状体。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-wbv3015","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-wbv3015","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：LaminariajaponicaAiesch.[L.ochotensisMiyabe]；EckloniakuromeOkam.；Undariapinnatifida(Harv.)Sur."}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-m6gh7bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-m6gh7bg","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋采收，由海中捞出，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-83z2zqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-83z2zqs","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-lr3bsqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-lr3bsqw","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.昆布藻体橄榄褐色,干后为暗褐色。成熟后革质呈带状,一般长2-6m,宽20-50cm,在叶片中央有两条平行纵走的浅沟,两沟中间较厚的部分为“中带部”,厚度约2-5mm,两侧边缘渐薄,且有波状皱褶,叶片基部楔形,厚成阶段则为扁圆形,下有一圆柱形或扁圆形的短柄,长5-15cm,柄和叶片内部均由髓部、皮层及表皮层组成。在外皮层内有粘液腔,腔内有分泌细胞,可分泌粘液至叶体表面,构成胶质层,使藻体粘滑而起保护作用。髓部由许多藻丝组成,藻丝细胞一端膨大呈喇叭管状。藻体幼龄期叶面光滑,小海带期叶片出现凹凸现象。一年生的藻体叶片下部,通常即能见到孢子囊群生长,呈近圆形斑块状;二年生的藻体几乎在全部叶片上都长出孢子囊群。固着器为叉状分枝的假根所组成。孢子成熟期秋季。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-s83fcis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-s83fcis","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.黑昆布藻体暗褐色至深褐色,革质,高30-100cm或更多。叶状体扁平宽大,中部稍厚,自其两侧一至二回羽状深裂,裂片长舌状或更长一些,略有皱,边缘一般均具粗锯齿。叶柄茎状,呈圆柱形或略扁,长4-12cm,直径3-8mm。藻体的皮层细胞中有粘液腔道作环状排列,为1-2层。髓部由不定走向的喇叭管丝组成。游孢子囊群于成熟的叶状体中央部分和侧生的裂片表面形成。固着器由二叉式分枝的假根组成。孢子囊初夏形成,孢子秋季成熟。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-3wzbuiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-3wzbuiv","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.裙带菜藻体黄褐色,软革质,高1-2m,宽50-100cm,叶状体扁平,中部有明显隆起的中肋,两侧渐薄柔软,形成多数羽状裂片,或呈大小不齐的缺刻,但无锯齿。叶面上散布许多黑色小斑点,为粘液细胞向表皮的开口处。成熟时,在下面叶柄两侧生有木耳状重叠褶皱的孢子叶,粘滑肉厚,其上密生孢子囊。叶柄下端为叉状分枝的假根所组成的固着器。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-yy7baoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-yy7baoy","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-3pqp6xu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-3pqp6xu","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.一般生长于大干潮线以下1-3m的岩礁上。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-6bne6x4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-6bne6x4","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生长于水肥、流急的低潮线附近或自大干潮线至7-8m深处的岩礁上。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-laf2079","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-laf2079","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.生长于风浪不太大、水质肥沃的海湾内,大干潮线下1-5m处的岩礁上。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-h3rvghh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-h3rvghh","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.自然生长的分布范围,我国限于辽东和山东两个半岛的肥沃海区。人工养殖已推广到浙江、福建、广东等地沿海。但为冷温带性种类。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-uzddtj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-uzddtj6","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.我国分布于浙江、福建沿海。为暖温带性种类。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-xt26exh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-xt26exh","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.我国裙带莱可分为两型:北海型(formadistansMiyabeetOkam.)藻体较为细长,羽状裂缺接近中肋,孢子叶距叶部有相当的距离。生长在大连、山东沿海。南海型(formatypicaYendo)恰好相反,即体形较短,羽状裂缺较浅,孢子叶接近叶部。浙江嵊泗列岛海域自然生长,即属此型。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-y65gyng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-y65gyng","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-xzbsugu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-xzbsugu","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性昆布原为冷水性海藻。其生长温度为0～13℃,以2～7℃为最适温度。昆布进行光合作用需有足够的光能,并从海水中吸收营养,由于海水混浊或透明度不同,适宜生长的水层也有深浅之别,深者在大于潮线下2～3m,浅者在水面下lm深处(在海水中追施氮、磷肥能提高昆布产量)。流速大的海区生长良好,反之生长很慢且易染病害。一般流速在50～80cm/s较适宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-foostgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-foostgy","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昆布是一种有明显世代交替的植物,藻体宝子囊释放游动孢子,萌发后形成配子体,配子体的卵囊和精囊结合形成合子,合子萌发产生幼孢子体,幼孢子体经无性繁殖即为昆布。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-b2zucpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-b2zucpy","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"养殖技术昆布苗虽有多种,但6～7月份培育的夏苗,是我国昆布养殖的主要苗源。在昆布养殖海区选择岩礁底、无污染的海区修建有制冷系统、从大海抽水净化的供水系统,和能调节光照的玻璃房结构的育苗室。我国南北方气温差异较大,故应在6～8月份,水温上升到23℃以前采好孢子。从海上选择叶片平直、宽大、厚实、健壮、颜色深褐、孢子羹多而成熟度适中、没有腐烂的个体作种昆布,搬到室内水中继续培育。水温保持在13～18℃之间,自然光照,追施氮400mg/m3、磷520mg/m3等,经14d叶表面产生孢子囊群。为了使其大量放散游孢子,可将种昆布悬挂在阴凉处阴干2～4h,投入水池,水温20～22℃,刺激其放散出游孢子,并能附着在用竹或棕绳制作的生长基上,然后进行培育。培育水温在10℃以下,每日保持10h以上光照时间,根据不同生长阶段通过遮光设备调节光量,由500lx提高到3000lx。育苗期施肥量,初期氮3xl0一6、磷0.15x10一6,中期氮4×l0一6、磷0.2×l0一6,后期氮5×10一6、磷0.15×l0一6。定期更换一部分海水,并保持一定的流速,使每小时更换水量能达到1/6～1/3,保持水质清洁。经100d左右,幼苗长到1～2cm长时,移到海上暂养,应及时遮帘、施肥和调节水层,使苗长到10～15cm时即可夹苗,采用“大把摇拔”的方法剔苗后,将苗夹于1.5～2m长的夹苗绳上。单棵夹苗棵距2.5～3cm,簇夹2～3棵苗为一簇,簇距5～7cm,然后将苗绳挂在筏子上,可采用垂养、平养、斜面养三种形式。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-mq0hfpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-mq0hfpz","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫客防治苗期主要有绿烂病、白烂病等病害,通过掌握适当的孢子附着的密度(不能过大),提高光照,加强洗刷,用0.05%或0.01%硫酸铵浸泡,都能起到防治效果。在养育期间,初期注意密养,长到1m左右时进行稀疏,并根据昆布不同生长期,采用调节光强度,冲洗浮泥,泼洒硝酸铵、硫酸铵等化肥,调节水层等措施,防治绿烂、白烂、点状白烂病。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-3tagooh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-3tagooh","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-2o6ur91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-2o6ur91","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别(1)昆布卷曲折叠成团状或缠结成把。全体呈绿褐色或黑褐色,表面附有白霜。用水浸软后展开成扁平长带状,长50-150cm,宽10-40cm,中央较厚,边缘较薄而呈波状。类革质,残存柄部扁圆柱形。气腥,味咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-3q6qg69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-3q6qg69","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)黑昆布片部卵形或扁圆形,1-2次羽状深裂,裂片长舌状,边缘有疏齿或全缘。气腥,味咸。水浸泡,手捻分层。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-3fhjgcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-3fhjgcj","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3)裙带菜片部1次羽状深裂,中央有隆起的中肋。气腥,味咸。以片大、体厚、色青绿者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ju4czl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ju4czl4","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版规定:以干燥品计算,昆布含碘(I)不得少于0.35%,黑昆布含碘(I)不得少于0.20%。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-myp4yny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-myp4yny","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-k4cekem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-k4cekem","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.昆布含多糖化合物,主要有三种:一种是褐藻酸盐(alginate),系褐藻酸(alginicacid)及其钠、钾、铰、钙盐等,褐藻酸是β-1,4结合的D-甘露糖醛酸(D-mannuronicacid)和α-1,4结合的L-古罗糖醛酸(L-guluronicacid)的聚合物;其次为岩藻依多糖(fucoidan),系含硫酸根、岩藻糖(fucose)和其他组分的多糖化合物;第三是海带淀粉(laminarin),系β-1,3葡聚糖(β-1,3glucan)的直链聚合物。还含脂多糖(lipopolysaccharide)和3个水溶性含砷糖。又含氨基酸成分:海带氨酸(laminine),谷氨酸(glutamicacid),天冬氨酸(asparticacid),脯氨酸(proline),丙氨酸(alanine),组氨酸(histidine),色氨酸(tryptophane),蛋氨酸(methionine)等。还含甘露醇(mannitol),牛磺酸(taurine),二十碳五烯酸(eicosapentaenoicacid),棕桐酸(palmiticacid),油酸(oleicacid),亚油酸(linoleicacid),γ-亚麻酸(γ-linolenicacid),十八碳四烯酸(octadecatetraenoicacid),花生四烯酸(arachidonicacid),岩藻甾醇(fucosterl)等。另含挥发油,内含主成分:荜澄茄油烯醇(cubenol),还含己醛(hexanal),(E)-2-己烯醛[(E)-2-hexenal],(E)-2-己烯醇[(E)-2-hexenol],己醇(hexanol),二甲苯(xylene),1-辛烯-3-醇(1-octen-3-ol),(E,E)-2,4-庚二烯醛[(E,E)-2,4-heptadienal],丁基苯(butylbenzene),(E)-2-辛烯醛[(E)-2-octenal],(E)-2-辛烯醇[(E)-2-octenol],(E,E)-2,4-辛二烯醛[(E,E)-2,4-octadienal],(E,Z)-2,6-壬二烯醛[(E,Z)-2,6-nonadienal],(E)-2-壬烯醛[(E)-2-nonenal],α-松油醇(α-terpineol),β-环柠檬醛(β-cyclocitral),β-高环柠檬醛(β-homocyclocitral),(E)-2-癸烯醇[(E)-decenol],(E,E)-2,4-癸二烯醛[(E,E)-2,4-decadienal],β-紫罗兰酮(β-ionone),十五烷(pentadecane),表荜澄茄油烯醇(epicubenol),以及肉豆蔻酸(myristicacid),ω-十六碳烯酸(ω-hexadecenoicacid),植物醇(phytol),二丁基-2-苯并[C]呋喃酮(dibutylphthalide)。又含胡萝卜素(carotene),维生素B1、B2、C、P和硫,钾,镁,钙,磷,铁,锰,钼,碘,铝,磷酸根,碳酸根,硫酸根等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-iq207dy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-iq207dy","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.黑昆布含褐藻酸及其钠盐,海带淀粉,甘露醇,维生素,卤化物,硫酸盐,磷酸盐,碘和其他微量元素。还含具抗血凝作用的多糖类成分:聚硫酸岩藻多糖(fucansulfate)B-Ⅰ、B-Ⅱ、C-Ⅰ、C-Ⅱ。又含抗纤溶酶的二苯双恶(dibenzo-1,4-dioxin)衍生物:鹅掌菜酚(eckol),6,6'-双鹅掌菜酚(6,6'-bieckol),8,8'-双鹅掌菜酚(8,8'-bieckol),二鹅掌菜酚(dieckol),间苯三酚岩藻鹅掌菜酚(phlorofucoeckol)A,2-O-间苯三酚基鹅掌菜酚(2-O-phloroeckol),2-O-间苯三酚基二鹅掌菜酚(2-O-phlorodieckol),2-O-间苯三酚基-6,6'-双鹅掌菜酚(2-O-phloro-6,6'-bieckol)。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-xkzopqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-xkzopqh","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.裙带菜全藻含多糖化合物,主要是褐藻酸,海带淀粉及脂多糖。还含挥发油,其主成分为荜澄茄油烯醇以及β-紫罗兰酮。又含类脂,其中磷脂占80%,磷脂中的40.6%～42.9%为磷脂酰胆碱(phosphatidylcholine);另含具吞噬细胞刺激剂作用的二半乳糖基二酰基甘油(digalactosyldiacylglycerol),单半乳糖基二酰基甘油(monogalactosyldiacylglycerol),磺酸基异鼠李糖基二脂酰基甘油(sulfoquinovosyldiacylglycerol)和含砷的类脂。还含甾醇类成分,主要是24-亚甲基胆甾醇(24-methylenecholesterol),胆甾醇(cholesterol),岩藻甾醇(fucosterol),大褐马尾藻甾醇(saringosterol)。又含阻抑胰岛素在脂肪组织中的降解作用的成分:眼晶体酸(ophthalmicacid)即是γ-L-谷氨酰-L-α-氨基丁酰基甘氨酸(γ-L-glutamyl-L-α-aminobutyrylglycine),去甲眼晶体酸(norophthalmicacid)即是γ-L-谷氨酰-L-丙氨酰基甘氨酸(γ-L-glutamyl-L-alanylglycine)。还含地芰普内酯(digiprolactone),无羁萜(friedelin),植物醇(pnytol)],N'-甲基烟酰胺(N'-methylnicotinamide),维生素(vitamin)B123.2μg/100g。又含亚麻酸(linolenicacid),花生四烯酸(arachidonicacid)等不饱和脂肪酸及卤化物,硫酸盐,磷酸盐,氧化钙,镁,钠和其他微量元素。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-qzxazag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-qzxazag","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-yakndp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-yakndp7","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.对甲状腺的作用：具作用是由于所含的碘、碘化物引起的。昆布可用来纠正由缺碘而引起的甲状腺机能不足，同时也可以暂时抑制甲状腺机能亢进的新陈代谢率而减轻症状，但不能持久，可作手术前的准备。碘化物进入组织及血液后，尚能促进病理产物如炎症渗出物的吸收，并能使病态的组织崩溃和溶解，故对活动性肺结核一般不用。昆布中所含之碘，较单纯的碘、碘化钾吸收慢，体内保留时间长，排出也慢。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-9h6pilb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-9h6pilb","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.降压作用：海带氨酸(Laminine)具有降压作用，海带氨酸单枸橼酸盐对麻醉兔静脉注射，可使血压短暂下降，此作用不被阿托品阻断；它不影响闭塞二侧颈总动脉或注射去甲肾上腺素引起之升压反应；在体及离体试验中，它都能抑制心跳振幅，但不影响心跳频率。对平滑肌有较显着的抑制作用，如小肠、支气管等。并能对抗乙酰胆碱、5-羟色胺、氯化钡引起之收缩；在离体鼠小肠上，对抗乙酰胆碱之效力为罂粟碱的0.8%。在离体豚鼠输精管上能增强去甲肾上腺素的作用。对蛙腹直肌之作用很弱。海带氨酸单盐酸盐亦能降压并抑制离体兔肠；但对离体兔心有轻度兴奋作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-3bn2ygv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-3bn2ygv","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.降血糖作用：昆布中所含褐藻淀粉30ml/kg灌胃对正常小鼠有明显的降血糖作用，剂量达100mg/kg时，7小时后血糖降低49%。褐藻酸钠的降血糖作用较差，灌胃无效，100mg/kg腹腔注射才有明显降血糖果作用，剂量达300m/kg时，7小时血糖可降低38%。对四氮嘧啶性高血糖，褐藻淀粉300mg/kg灌胃，24小时后血糖降低61%；褐藻酸钠300mg/kg腹腔注射；血糖降低39%，而灌胃无效。其他作用见海藻条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ovwmi9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ovwmi9l","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.降血脂和抗凝作用：海带多糖多次灌胃，能明显地抑制高血脂鸡血清总胆固醇、甘油三酯的含量上升，并能减少鸡主动脉内膜粥样斑块的形成及发展。海带多糖在体内外均有抗凝血作用，其抗凝活性为7肝素u/mg。因不少冠心病患者除有高血脂外，其血液常处于高凝状态。因此，海带多糖同时具有降血脂和抗凝作用，对临床有一定意义。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-w8g1dmc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-w8g1dmc","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.抗放射作用：海带多糖1次注射，能明显地提高900拉德照射小鼠存活率，并随给药剂量增加存活率提高，能显着地保护照射动物的造血组织。因此，海带多糖对于预防放疗所致造血组织损伤，刺激造血恢复及增强癌症患者的免疫功能，合并放射治疗可能有一定实际意义。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-k0mqypt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-k0mqypt","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.其他作用：海藻昆布流浸膏对感染血吸虫尾蚴的家兔，有保护作用(煎剂无效)。以流浸膏2g/kg在感染后1天开始口服，连续90天，则兔体内血吸虫虫体余存数较对照组显着减少，特别是肝脏病变远较对照组为轻微，正常结构大致保存，仅见少量虫卵结节形成，周围纤维化不显着，尤其是新生虫卵很难找到。小鼠口服海藻、昆布及全蝎、蜈蚣等之复方(化癌丹)煎剂，对艾氏腹水癌有抑制作用。昆布素对大鼠的网状肉瘤IRE(腹水型)则并无影响。从L.Cloustoni中提得的硫酸昆布素M，静脉注射(人)后清除血脂、增加脂蛋白之电泳能力、改变脂蛋白之分布情况皆与肝素相似，唯持续时间较短(4-6小时)。肌肉注射(100mg)效果不显着，可能由于剂量不够。海带中提取的藻胶酸钠，对动物股动脉之出血，据云有止血作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-1kjt306","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-1kjt306","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】海带氨酸对小鼠的LD50，静脉注射为394mg/kg，腹腔注射为2.98-3.57g/kg。褐藻酸钠小鼠腹腔注射的LD50为1013mg/kg。昆布中提取的褐藻淀粉及褐藻粉硫酸酯小鼠腹腔注射的LD50分别为980mg/kg和689.8mg/kg。给人每日服3次，每次330mng，连服2个月，未见毒副反应。毒性：海带多糖腹腔注射，对小鼠的LD50为158.5±67.0mg/kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ck4njc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ck4njc5","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】取本品10g,剪碎,加蒸馏水200ml,浸4h,取滤液浓缩至1/2。取浓缩液2～3ml,加硝酸1滴,硝酸银试液数滴,产生黄色乳状沉淀,在氨液中微溶,在硝酸中不溶。(检查碘)"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-s380tim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-s380tim","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去杂质，用水漂净，切成宽丝，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-eizwm2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-eizwm2k","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】咸；寒；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-6uo9oeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-6uo9oeb","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；胃；肾；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-70inf92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-70inf92","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】消痰软坚；利水退肿。主瘰疬；瘿瘤；噎膈；（疒颓）疝脚气水肿"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-45eps14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-45eps14","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，5-15g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-66i0h9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-66i0h9r","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】脾胃虚寒蕴湿者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-66t10kh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-66t10kh","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制剂】昆布眼药水。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-rqnn74d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-rqnn74d","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-xw4oszy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-xw4oszy","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经疏》：昆布，咸能软坚，具性润下，寒能除热散结，故主十二种水肿、瘿瘤聚结气、瘘疮。东垣云：瘿坚如石者，非此不除，正咸能软坚之功也。详其气味性能治疗，与海藻大略相同。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-dxv0iah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-dxv0iah","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草汇》：昆布之性，雄于海藻，噎症恒用之，盖取其祛老痰也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-wc9ylxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-wc9ylxf","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《名医别录》：主十二种水肿，瘿瘤聚结气，瘘疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-078lj1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-078lj1b","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《药性论》：利水道，去面肿，去恶疮鼠瘘。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ommya6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ommya6a","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草拾遗》：主颓卵肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ljpnshx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ljpnshx","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.崔禹锡《食经》：治九瘘风热，热瘅，手脚疼痹，以生啖之益人。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-pxnagqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-pxnagqm","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草通玄》：主噎膈。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-w31e4ty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-w31e4ty","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.姚可成《食物本草》：裙带莱，主女人赤白带下，男子精泄梦遗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-vunwzpi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-vunwzpi","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《玉楸药解》：泄水去湿，破积软坚。清热利水，治气臌水胀，瘰疬瘿瘤，TUI疝恶疮，与海藻、海带同功。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-ivdkxzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-ivdkxzg","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《现代实用中药》：治水肿，淋疾，湿性脚气。又治甲状腺肿，慢性气管炎，咳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240902085620-1obdwiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085620-1obdwiv","updated":"20240902085629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902085621-kw5yahr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902085621-kw5yahr","updated":"20240902085629"}},{"ID":"20240902085622-izk4nmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902085622-izk4nmw","updated":"20240902085629"}}]}